      reply: 'Nadia: A note. It''s on your desk. Don''t touch the red part.'
      next: -1
      karma: 0
    - text: Nadia, what happened here?
      reply: 'Nadia: He came at six. Lights off, one by one.'
      next: 1
      karma: 0
  - line: Kessler locked himself behind his shutter. It didn't save him.
    choices:
    - text: How do I get in there?
      reply: 'Nadia: Kessler''s code. Ask Ben what day it was.'
      next: -1
      karma: 0
    - text: Did anyone make it out?
      reply: 'Nadia: Maya, Derek and Sam ran for the silo.|Nadia: Please. Get them
        out.'
      next: -1
      karma: 1
    - text: Serves Kessler right.
      reply: 'Nadia: ...he was scared. We all were. You too.'
      next: -1
      karma: -1
  afterLine: 'Nadia: Maya, Derek, Sam. The silo. Get them out.'
