--- !u!114 &2079067060
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 2079067057}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 65f27eeb84e620841b41716250897d8e, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::GhostNPC
  ghostName: Priya
  nodes:
  - line: You came back. Why would anyone come back here?
    choices:
    - text: I left my keys. Priya... are you-
      reply: 'Priya: Dead? Yes. It doesn''t hurt anymore. The dark does.'
      next: 1
      karma: 0
    - text: Where is everyone else?
      reply: 'Priya: Some of us never left. Some are still hiding. Listen for them.'
      next: 1
      karma: 0
    - text: (Back away slowly)
      reply: 'Priya: ...everyone backs away. Even now.'
      next: -1
      karma: 0
  - line: The power's dead. He pulled the fuses so nobody could see what he did.
    choices:
    - text: Where did he hide them?
      reply: 'Priya: Where we used to sit. The meeting room. Your desks. The little
        closet by Kessler''s shutter.'
      next: -1
      karma: 0
    - text: I'm sorry this happened to you.
      reply: 'Priya: ...thank you. Nobody ever said that.|Priya: The fuses are where
        we used to sit. Go.'
      next: -1
      karma: 1
    - text: I don't care. I just want my keys.
      reply: 'Priya: That''s what you said about Tomas too.|Priya: Find the fuses
        yourself.'
      next: -1
      karma: -1
  afterLine: 'Priya: The fuses. Where we used to sit. Hurry.'
